{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"night-owl-light-day","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Night Owl Light","description":"Made for people who code in daylight, with accessible contrast.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Night Owl Light","path":"themes/night-owl-light-day.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/night-owl-light-day.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Night Owl Light\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fbfbfb\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#403f53\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#f0f0f0\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#f0f0f0\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#f0f0f0\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#f0f0f0\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e4e8ec\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d3e8f8\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#f0f0f0\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#d9d9d9\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#2aa298\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#2aa298\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#2aa298\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d3e8f8\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e4e8ec80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#2aa298\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#d9d9d9\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e64d49\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#08916a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#c96765\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e64d49\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#989fb1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c96765\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#aa0982\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#994cc3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0c969b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4876d6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#aa0982\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0c969b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#994cc3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4876d6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#bc5454\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Night Owl Light\n\nMade for people who code in daylight, with accessible contrast.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Night Owl Light** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nInspired by the Night Owl Light palette by Sarah Drasner (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fbfbfb` |\n| Text | `#403f53` |\n| Accent | `#2aa298` |\n| Keywords | `#994cc3` |\n| Strings | `#c96765` |\n| Functions | `#4876d6` |\n| Types | `#0c969b` |\n| Comments | `#989fb1` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}